:: day1ft_table_hub [nobr]
<h2>📦 Bedside Table</h2>
<p>Items and prescriptions. The material evidence of being cared for.</p>

<<if not $d1ft_npc_items>>
<div class="interaction-card side">
  <h4>🌸 The Things You Carried</h4>
  <p>Moonflower. Jasmine. A letter. A handkerchief. A ginger root. Five gifts from five people who didn't know what you'd keep.</p>
  [[Examine → |day1ft_npc_items]]
</div>
<</if>>

<<if $d1ft_exam and not $d1ft_npc_vael3>>
<div class="interaction-card side">
  <<npcPortrait "vael" "Mistress Vael">>
  <h4>⚗ Vael's Prescriptions</h4>
  <p>Five vials in a wooden case, not four. A knock, three raps, no patience.</p>
  [[Answer → |day1ft_npc_vael3]]
</div>
<</if>>

<<if $d1ft_npc_items and (not $d1ft_exam or $d1ft_npc_vael3)>>
  <p class="empty-note">Just the table now, quiet. Nothing else here needs you.</p>
<</if>>

<div class="nav-return">
  [[← Back to room → |day1_hub_futa]]
</div>
